00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.500
Naite waratte kagaiyaite

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.750
Udemakutte arukidasou

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.960
(Kitto alright nayamu wa go sign)

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.210
(Kichin to yarimashou)

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:33.580
Jiyuu sugiru tte nante fujiyuu nan deshou

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:36.920
Datte tokenai no yo

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.330
Rironchi jikkenchi spiral

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.420
Maido utedo katte mo

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.000
(Nani o tameshite mite mo)

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.670
Nengan kanatte shikuhakku

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.500
(Cheat ja nai yo life hack)

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.960
Harete ippo fumidaseru license

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.210
Kore kara ga hajimari

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:57.460
Kyou kara mieru yo chiisai hoshi

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:00.830
Terashitete ne mune no naka o

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.250
Naite waratte kagaiyaite

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.830
Shigoto no mae wa shinkokyuu

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:11.000
Hibike te o nobashita shintenchi

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.330
Yume wa kitto te no naka

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:17.750
Kitto dekiru original

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.460
Door o akete welcome de ikou

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.960
(Sore ja koko ga start)

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.460
(Kitto alright nayamu wa go sign)

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.880
(Kichin to yarimashou)

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:35.790
This is my shop?!

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:40.040
This is just too much!

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.880
This is... my shop...

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:02.670
What'll I do...?

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:07.460
And after Master went and found it for me...

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:09.040
But it will go fine!

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.290
We're talking about a shop run by
Ophelia Millis's apprentice, here!

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:16.290
Right, I've already come all this way,

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.750
so I should at least start by
checking over the state of things!

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:21.080
I'll head inside first...

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.790
Could this be...?

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.210
Ah, it really is a medicinal herb!

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:31.630
Now that I think of it, I did hear it was
supposed to have fields for those...

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.330
Did the seeds spread?

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.670
Alright!

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:39.920
I should be able to save a bit on ingredients!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:42.170
Weeds, herbs, weeds, herbs...!

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:45.040
Trash, trash, money! Trash! Money!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:49.380
It's less filthy than I expected...

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.750
I wonder if there's a cleaning seal?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.500
What's in here...?

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.250
Ah!

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.580
An alchemic cauldron!

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.000
A glass kiln!

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:02.080
They left behind all their tools?!

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:07.330
E-even though the place
only cost 10,000 rhea...!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.540
Wait, gotta focus for now...

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.380
The kitchen isn't furnished
with a stove or oven...

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:21.920
<b>Rumble...</b>

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.920
Guess I'll be dining out for the time being.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.330
Hooray!

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:28.790
There's a bath!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:31.000
That's an alchemist's shop for you!

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:34.130
Bath, there's a bath...!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:36.750
A magical crystal?

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.250
Then this must be the core for the seal.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.080
In that case...

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.580
It really was a cleaning seal!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.500
Hmm?

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.920
There's a security seal too.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.830
I'll have to charge it up later.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.250
There are eight rooms in total upstairs.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.920
This looks like it'd be good for my room.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.880
Still, this sure is some dust.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:15.880
Now then...

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.130
I think I just need to give it
a polishing with a cloth later.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.540
So these are the herb fields, huh...?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.130
Oh...!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.580
Thank goodness! It hasn't dried up.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.580
Seems like I'll be able to manage after all.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:45.880
In that case, I should start by getting
the basic furniture I'll need...

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:49.960
I'm pretty sure I saw a general store
along the way...

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.040
E-excuse me...

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.750
Welcome!

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:57.790
Ah!

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:02.290
U-um, I just moved here to this village.

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:05.670
I-I'm an alchemist,
and my name is Sarasa Feed...

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:06.920
I knew it!
I-I'm an alchemist,<b>
</b>and my name is Sarasa Feed...<b></b>

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.500
I've come here to this village, so...

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.710
Where are you from?!
I've come here to this village, so...<b></b>

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.330
Er, from the capital.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.210
The capital?! Amazing!

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.750
That's as much city-living as it gets!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.040
R-right...

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.170
That's true...

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:25.420
Wow, you city girls sure do dress
totally different than folks around here!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.040
Y-you think...?

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.830
This is old, though.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:33.250
Around here, folks tend to think
it's fine as long as it fits!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.330
I don't think your clothes would
look out of place in the capital.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.040
Huh?! You mean it?!

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.710
Hey, when you have the time,
could you tell me stories?!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:45.130
About the capital, and fashion, and sweets!

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.290
Y-yeah.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.630
Ah, you came to buy stuff, didn't you?

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.040
What are you looking for?

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.710
Yes, well...

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.460
I'll try my best to get you a discount!

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:59.460
We'll deliver the bedding
once the cotton is delivered!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.960
I really appreciate
how cheap you made things.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.830
Would you like to borrow a cart?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.290
No, I'll be fine.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.130
It should all fit in my bag.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.710
That's amazing...

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:11.130
Yes, but I didn't make it myself.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.630
When are you opening for business?

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:15.420
There are still a lot of things
I need to take care of first.

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:19.380
I have to touch up the place,
and I still need a lot of things too.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:21.710
Oh, I see... Ah!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.710
Huh...?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.460
Mrs. Elles!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:25.710
Hmm?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:30.210
What're you shouting about, Lorea?

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:33.540
This is your neighbor, Mrs. Elles!

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.920
P-pleased to meet you.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.750
Well I say she's your neighbor,
but there's a good bit of distance between you.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.920
She's a very well-acquainted woman.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:41.040
Lorea, could you start by telling me
what's going on here...?

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.580
Ah, um...
Lorea, could you start by telling me<b>
</b>what's going on here...?<b></b>

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.580
Ah, um...
Ms. Sarasa here is the new alchemist<b>
</b>who came to the village...<b></b>

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:46.500
Ms. Sarasa here is the new alchemist
who came to the village...

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.920
Sorry for having you suddenly
show me around the village.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.170
Don't you worry yourself about it!

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:58.790
To think, we've had an alchemist
come here again!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:03.040
That shop was originally
run by an old man.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:06.540
But then his back gave out on him,
and his son came to pick him up.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:08.580
So that's what happened?

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:12.630
Well, potions are absolutely essential
out in a small village like this.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.920
I mean, you've always got gatherers
heading out into the forest.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:18.750
You shouldn't be hurting for
customers, that's for sure.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.420
I'll give it my all!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:27.920
Guess there's no harm in
getting to know everybody!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.420
Just leave it to me!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.750
Thank you!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.210
Hey there!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.790
This is old man Geberk,
the village carpenter.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.080
Elles, eh...?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.630
Who's the little lady behind you?

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:44.790
She just moved here, and her name's Sarasa.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:47.040
If you can believe it, she's an alchemist!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.540
P-pleased to meet you.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:55.040
So, you want a bed to start with?

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:58.750
Ah, yes. And then I'll ask for
repairs to the shop after that.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.670
Still, I've got other folks waiting.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:04.080
I can't go giving you
top priority, little lady.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.170
I-I'll wait my turn, of course.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.750
Right, so the price is...

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:10.630
Elles?

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.080
What're you going on about?!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:15.880
You can give her a bed or two
as a housewarming gift!

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:18.040
Ah, no, I'll pay for it!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.250
Alright.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:21.790
She's even littler than my grandkids,

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.040
so it'd damage my reputation if I didn't
give her a welcome gift, sure enough.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.750
Th-thank you!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.330
Now then, let's get going.

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.460
R-right!

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.750
I-I didn't make him mad, did I...?

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:39.000
If you need any metalwork done,
ask Gizdo here.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.920
He can do some real detailed work.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:43.790
I'll definitely ask you for some things
once I've earned some more money.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.630
Feel free to come by anytime.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:49.330
Thank goodness... He seems nice.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:53.080
Why don't I go ahead and
introduce you to the mayor too?

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.290
Ah, right.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.580
We didn't have one of those
back in the capital...

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:01.080
Well yeah, guess you wouldn't!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.460
That was a close one...!
Not like you can just go meet the king<b>
</b>at the drop of a hat!<b></b>

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:05.250
I was worried she would think I was rude!
Not like you can just go meet the king<b>
</b>at the drop of a hat!<b></b>

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.670
My name is Sarasa, and I'm an alchemist.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.460
It's a great pleasure meet you!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.880
You don't have to act all humble.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.880
You alchemists are the real elites, after all!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.630
We're overjoyed just to have you
come here to our village!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.630
Ah, no, I'm still just a novice...

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.330
Stay modest! Modest...!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.960
We're here for a meal, Delal!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.500
Welcome!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:33.000
It's rare to see you in here
right around noon, Elles!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.330
Cut it out!

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:37.330
You're making it sound like
I come here every night to drink!

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.500
Since you pay me, we're not exactly
talking on an equal playing field here!

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.750
So, who's the girl?

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:48.420
There's no point in hiding it!
She's this village's alchemist!

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.630
U-um, my name is Sarasa...!

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:54.170
I'll be opening a shop in the village!
It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:57.170
I run the inn here, and the name's Delal.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:58.790
Here's hoping you end up a regular!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:09:59.790
Right!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.630
Still, you're so young.
Are you gonna be okay running a shop?

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:05.920
I was shocked too!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.080
To think, such a young girl's
gonna run it all on her own!

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:14.130
You must've been awful unlucky, to end up
here out in the sticks with nothing around.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:16.540
Even if you're thinking it, you shouldn't
go around saying stuff like that!

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:20.500
A-ah, no! I wouldn't say
that there's nothing here...!

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:23.830
There are medicinal herbs
growing in front of the shop,

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:26.330
and they look to be doing great
despite not being tended!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.290
The soil and water around here must be great!

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:33.130
Oh, and the wind feels so nice.

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.580
That's something you can't
experience in the capital!

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.460
So, well...

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:40.830
I love this village!

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.330
I'm so glad to have come here!

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:45.710
I see...

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.460
Alright, got it!

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.380
I'll treat you this time around!

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.000
Huh?!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.750
You better pay up, though.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.250
Aw, don't be stingy!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.750
P-please hold on,
I can't accept such generosity...!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.920
Don't worry about it!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.710
It's like a welcome gift, right?!

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:04.960
Hey!

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.250
You say you're an alchemist?

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.130
H-hello...

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.210
This dish is a local specialty of the village.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.830
A little something to help get acquainted.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.920
Oh? I wonder what sort of...

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:23.630
Was that too intense for a young lady, eh?

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:25.250
No need to hold back! Give it a shot!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.080
Cut that out, you drunkards!
No need to hold back! Give it a shot!<b></b>

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.330
Cut that out, you drunkards!

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.420
I'm exhausted...

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.080
I didn't get along with them at all!

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:44.290
But I just can't eat that stuff...

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:50.330
Was socializing always this difficult...?

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:59.130
I wonder what they all think of me...?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:13.960
Do they think they can't put
their trust in a child like me...?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:24.630
If I don't get any customers...

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.420
Ah, hold on! I'm coming now!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.250
Ow! I'm coming!

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.210
Welcome!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.290
I can't believe it...

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.330
Master?!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.040
Hey there, Sarasa.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.880
I never expected you
to show up so suddenly.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.540
What, is it strange to come see
how my apprentice is doing?

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.540
Not really, but...

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:17.880
No wait, it totally is!

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:20.710
I mean, this place is so far away!

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:23.080
Right, it took me three whole days.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:25.580
Yeah, it takes so long...

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:27.000
Wait, three days?!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:30.040
After taking a carriage from town
I needed to cross mountains and valleys,

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:32.000
and it took a whole month!

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.670
That's because I ran.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.460
You ran here in three days?!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:36.580
There's no way that's possible!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.420
When you train yourself properly,
you can make it work.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:42.040
You sound like a soldier there...

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.040
Speaking of soldiers...

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:47.500
I never taught you how to fight, now did I?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:48.830
Huh?

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:51.330
It's dangerous to neglect your training.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:54.210
You need to be prepared to
defeat monsters yourself

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:57.210
in order to procure alchemic ingredients.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:58.790
I'll be fine!

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:00.880
We had field practice for that sort of stuff!

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:03.710
When it comes to martial arts,
it's more effective to have an instructor.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.790
I don't even have a sword!

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.330
It's yours.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.790
Are you ready?

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:14.630
This sword looks pretty expensive...

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.420
It's sturdy, but it's nothing all that special.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.580
Take your stance,
and show me what you've got.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.790
She really wants me to use this sword?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:27.460
Oh? Sarasa, are you really thinking
your blade will ever reach me?

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.250
Now you've said it, Master...

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:31.630
No worries.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:33.830
If it looks like you're going to croak,
I'll heal you.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.540
I'm not exactly fond of pain, you know!

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.330
Come on, is that all you've got?!

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:49.580
Geez, give me a break...!

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:54.130
Keep it up!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.920
Thanks for the meal!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.920
Delicious!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.130
It's the taste of Ms. Maria's cooking!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.380
She bugged me to bring it along.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:08.080
It's like all my exhaustion and pain
were blown away.

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:10.080
My resentment's still
holding on fine, though...

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:13.830
So, does it look like you'll be able
to make progress on this front?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.920
It seems like the shop will take up
a lot of my time once I get it running.

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:20.330
It took till morning yesterday
to get my merchandise ready.

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:23.580
That's because you really are
all on your own right now.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:26.330
You're lucky because
you've got Ms. Maria, Master.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.210
You can find someone like that too.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:33.920
I get the feeling that your life would be
a mess without her.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.630
I can't exactly deny it!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.460
So Master, what did you really come for?

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.380
It wasn't just the sword training, right?

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.130
I came to set up a transfer circle.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.460
A transfer circle? Here?

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.670
Alright, it's working fine.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:03.790
Send on over anything you want to sell me.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.130
I'll buy it for the market price
in the capital.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.420
And send over a note with
any ingredients you need.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.040
If I can get ahold of it, I'll send it your way.

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.170
Thank you!

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:16.130
Now then, guess it's time to get going.

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:18.670
Huh?! Please, stay the night!

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:22.170
If I leave the shop alone for too long,
Maria will chew me out about it.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.290
What, are you feeling lonely...?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.170
Nope, not at all!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:32.000
You ended up suddenly out here
in the country.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.960
I figured if I found you crying about it,
I'd have to bring you on back with me.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:37.920
I'm telling you, I'm fine!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.500
I see.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:43.040
Well then, farewell!

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:52.830
That wasn't the point to go
acting all kind like that...

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.330
Besides, she could have stayed the night!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.500
I mean, it'll take her three days to get back.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.580
I wonder where she's
running through about now...?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:07.920
When she gets back,
Ms. Maria will be there waiting for her.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.670
Maybe...

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.580
Maybe I really should have stayed there too...

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:25.540
Am I still not ready to be on my own?

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.540
What's going on...?

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.130
Ah, Ms. Sarasa!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.380
Good morning!

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.670
What is all this?

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:56.710
Hey, I brought your bed, little lady.

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:58.710
And here's the cotton for the bedding!

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:02.630
I'll go ahead and fix
the broken sign and walls, too.

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:04.080
But what about the people ahead of me...?

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:08.460
Everyone from the village said
to give your shop top priority.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:09.540
What...?

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.670
Sorry about before.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:13.880
A-ah, no...

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:15.880
How should I put it...?

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:21.380
We heard you say you loved the village,
and that made us all really happy...

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:22.130
Huh...?

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:25.580
I love this village!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:29.710
We all took a liking to you
when we heard that.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.040
And we figured we could
get away with a little prank...

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:37.380
Anyway, we'll go make you
a nice sturdy fence, just watch!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:41.670
Lorea really went and chewed them out.

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:42.420
Huh?

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.920
I heard about what happened at
the dining hall from Mrs. Elles.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:49.330
And I was worried you might
come to hate it here, Ms. Sarasa.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.000
Everybody loves this village.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:55.670
And I think they just got overly worked up,

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:58.040
since they were so happy you came here.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:04.250
Mrs. Elles and Mrs. Delal took a liking to you,
like you were their own child.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:08.080
And I'll always be
on your side too, Ms. Sarasa!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.540
Even though we only just met...

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.750
Ms. Lorea...

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:17.580
They're a clumsy lot,
but don't think badly of them, alright?

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.630
Sorry for having you help out like this.

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:34.170
Think nothing of it!
I love doing stuff like this!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.670
Still, this sure is pretty cloth!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.000
It's environmental tuning fabric.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:42.000
It adjusts temperature and
humidity levels all on its own.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:44.210
I'll give you a few sheets of it later.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.960
Really?! Hooray!

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.790
Ms. Lorea, are you fine staying this late?
It's getting dark out.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.670
We've come this far, so I'd like to at least

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.750
get the bedding done
before the end of the day...

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:58.500
Then would you like to stay the night?

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.380
Huh?! Do you really mean it?!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.670
I'll go let my dad know!

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:03.750
Ms. Lorea?!

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:09.670
Wow, so your master
gave you sword training?

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:11.630
She told me to train myself.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:15.000
And since she gave me the sword,
I've got to keep practicing with it.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.000
Even though you're an alchemist?

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.960
That's the sort of master she is.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:22.380
But once I open the shop, I won't have
all that much time to spare...

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:25.790
If only I could at least hire a sales clerk...

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.040
Um, could I do the job...?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:28.880
Eh?!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.880
Could I do the job?!

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:32.830
Not that I know if I'd be any help or not!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.330
Huh?! But don't you have to
help out your family?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:39.210
Only once a month or so,
when my parents need to go stock up...

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:42.330
So as long as I can take then off,
it should be fine.

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:48.130
Ah, but I guess it isn't quite so simple
to work in an alchemist's shop...

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:52.790
You can find someone like that too.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.630
I'm sure you'd be fine, Ms. Lorea.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:00.040
And I'd teach you whatever
you need to know,

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.670
so I would love to have you work for me
as long as possible.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:04.500
Y-you mean it?!

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.500
Could I ask you to do it?

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:07.500
Yeah!

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.500
I'll keep on working hard, for as
long as you don't feel like firing me!

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.420
I look forward to
working together, Ms. Lorea!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.580
Um, the whole "Ms." thing is a bit much...

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.170
T-then...

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.630
Here's to working together, Lorea!

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:23.960
Right, Ms. Sarasa!

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:29.750
Do you want to take a bath, Lorea?

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:31.790
Huh? A bath?

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:37.130
Phew, this bath's so nice and warm!

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.540
That sure is some nice growth...

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:40.880
Ms. Sarasa?

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:43.830
I-it's nothing!

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:47.750
Are baths common in the capital?

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:50.540
Around here, even the mayor's house
doesn't have one.

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:54.040
Only rich folks have them
in their own home.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.290
Is that so...?

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:59.790
Still, you can take one here
whenever you want, Lorea.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.250
Glad to hear it!

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:06.040
I really am glad you're here, Lorea...

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:08.880
I want to be of use to the village, so...

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:10.250
Lorea...?

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:14.710
My eyes are spinning, Ms. Sarasa!

00:22:14.710 --> 00:22:16.880
Wh-what's wrong?! Are you feeling bad?!

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:20.790
Nah, I feel all floaty, and dizzy...

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:23.710
A-are you drunk on magical power?!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:29.630
You're so strong, Mish Sarasa...

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:30.750
I'm sorry.
You're so strong, Mish Sarasa...<b></b>

00:22:30.750 --> 00:22:33.460
You got drunk because I added
magical power to the bath.

00:22:33.460 --> 00:22:35.670
Just rest up for the day, okay?

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:38.500
Aren'tcha gonna sleep too, Mish Sarasa?

00:22:38.630 --> 00:22:41.540
I will, down here on the floor.

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:44.540
Huh?! Come on, let's sleep together!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:47.250
I'm staying over and everything!

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:50.210
And we finished the bedding!

00:22:50.210 --> 00:22:51.210
Right...

00:23:06.170 --> 00:23:08.670
It's finally finished!

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:15.250
<b>Now accepting orders</b>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:16.750
Well then, it's time to open your...

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:18.710
Our shop!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:21.170
It's open!

00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:22.580
Please help us!

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Miscellaneous Goods</b>

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>(Washbasin, Tableware, etc):</b>

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Cotton and Cloth:</b>

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Store Repairs:</b>
